{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"screens\": [\n    {\"sec\":\"S01\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S02\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S03\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S04\",\"score\":3,\"wrong\":\"把“盼着对方喜欢他不再收着的样子”偏成了“希望坦白能让彼此更亲近”，改变了部分表达心意的动机。\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S05\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S06\",\"score\":3,\"wrong\":\"无；主要遗漏了他对对方是否也舍不得结束这段亲近的试探。\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S07\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S08\",\"score\":3,\"wrong\":\"把“觉得两人说不定能这么好很久”偏成了“两人可能发展得更好”，将维持当下的美好偏成了关系继续发展、变得更好。\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S09\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S10\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S11\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S12\",\"score\":3,\"wrong\":\"无；主要遗漏了“顾不上对方是否一样在乎”这一关键态度，原文强调的是不再计较感情是否对等，只想尽力给予。\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S13\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S14\",\"score\":3,\"wrong\":\"把“不想再逼自己讨永远不变的保证”说成“不想再逼对方承诺永远不变”，将重点从不再强迫自己索求保证，偏成了不向对方施压。\"}\n  ],\n  \"story\":4,\n  \"story_note\":\"全曲主线基本完全一致：从小心翼翼地靠近、害怕成为负担，到逐渐感受到可能存在的相互需要，再到坦然承认喜欢、不再隐藏；对未来失去亲近的恐惧始终存在，但最终不再执着于永远不变的保证，而选择珍惜当下、真诚陪伴。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7f8781e7-719d-4188-8b88-7189ef33724c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T214606240599Z", "elapsed_seconds": 201.141, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T21:49:27.375444+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ca78f2eb2d9f2f2d6acdea8c53216f6bc3b637af74b34fc147fd6a30539fb30e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completi